If that is how it works, then why would a trigger ever go before a static? &nbsp;I personally think it makes more sense to have static effects always apply first, but the official ruling is card order.

Also how would you time Aegis of Resurrection versus incapacitation? &nbsp;It is obvious the way it is intended to work, but how would you explain the timing? &nbsp;Both the wording in the manual to remove all their cards from the game and flip them and the wording on the card would seem to be triggers.
